Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:12.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:18.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:25.07,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:31.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:48.50,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:54.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:01:01.08,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.49,0:01:06.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:13.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.73,0:01:25.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:40.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宿敌奈落从我们的面前消失得无影无踪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.93,0:01:42.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50年前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:46.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛这个强盗促成了奈落的诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.97,0:01:50.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而与鬼蜘蛛曾经结盟的罗刹鬼勘助
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:52.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,临死之前又碰见了桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.71,0:01:54.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同一个时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:56.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一路打探奈落的行踪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也碰到了一个意外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:06.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第88话 猿神大爷的三个小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.09,0:02:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个村子的气氛好祥和哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:14.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子还没有被奈落糟蹋过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.73,0:02:16.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我总觉得这一带…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.53,0:02:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得什么 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:23.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么每块田都乱七八糟的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:24.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.61,0:02:26.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会是野猪出来捣乱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:28.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是好像又不太像…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.11,0:02:29.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得有点怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:32.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.01,0:02:33.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别走 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.85,0:02:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村里的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:36.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个银头发的年轻人请等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:37.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你头上长了一对耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:38.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然不是人类吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.49,0:02:41.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是在说犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:47.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你救救我们吧 犬神大爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然叫你犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.47,0:02:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.87,0:02:53.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:57.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:03:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么犬神？在说我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.38,0:03:07.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腌菜？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.15,0:03:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷大驾光临
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:12.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点微薄的小菜不成敬意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.85,0:03:16.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在整个村里 只剩下这点东西可以吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:17.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了犬神大爷之外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.06,0:03:20.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想不出还有谁可以救我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:21.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快用力扇 用力扇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然以为犬夜叉可以救他们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.17,0:03:27.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看恐怕拜错神了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这话什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个村子被那些猴子搞得一蹋糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.07,0:03:32.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害得大家都没饭吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.41,0:03:33.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:34.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从前的人不是说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:36.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猴子最怕的就是狗了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:39.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何 犬神大爷一定要救救我们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.48,0:03:42.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要帮我们赶走那些猴子…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:45.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 这个忙我们帮定了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 我哪里是什么犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:51.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶跑几只猴子一点都不难啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:53.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我们哪有那么多鬼时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:54.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点你放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:55.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟珊瑚会趁这个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:58.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处打探奈落的行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:03:59.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.73,0:04:02.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 这里的村民那么可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:04.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会见死不救吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直是跟我开玩笑嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:13.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓猴子关我什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:14.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那有什么办法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你是犬神大爷嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:18.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是犬神大爷嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:20.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不怕死的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:27.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猴怪出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:28.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只狗妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:31.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明知道我们最恨的就是狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:33.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏替村民出头修理我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天要让你好看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:38.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是这样 这场戏还有什么看头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:41.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢的就是对付妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是小猴子哎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:51.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 好可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 村子里的作物是你们糟蹋的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.43,0:05:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事是我们不对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.23,0:05:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了保证以后我们不会再犯错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:07.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把这个精灵石交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:10.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 居然低声下气主动认错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:12.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再不收就不够意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:13.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么？七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我劝你最好别太大意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.95,0:05:19.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们小妖最喜欢给别人东西然后再从中陷害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:22.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好还是别收下比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:24.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:29.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛不早点说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活该上当
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:34.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只狗妖怪 这下动不了了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有见过猴子红红的屁股啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是笨蛋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶作剧该有个限度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:46.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 你再厉害也没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:49.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你解得开我们的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:51.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不然别想甩掉那块大石头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.15,0:05:54.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？我倒要试试…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:03.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:05.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天要让你们尝尝苦头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.43,0:06:12.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下知道厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去追他们 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.51,0:06:19.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:22.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你先在这边等我们一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:25.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:27.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是让他们跑掉了就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像刚刚他们说的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:31.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有施咒的人才解得开咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:32.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:37.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 弥勒法师我问你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:40.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是答应犬夜叉 要到处打探奈落的消息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在既没有鼻子超灵的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:44.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉得到四魂之玉碎片的戈薇也不在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:46.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说要怎么找呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才要不是那么说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:52.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想犬夜叉会乖乖帮那些村民吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.34,0:06:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要振作起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:02.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.99,0:07:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁怕你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.73,0:07:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:21.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟们 合体…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:42.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陀螺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:43.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,栗子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,承让了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.34,0:07:58.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 大家快点过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:04.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要不要吃点心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:14.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么要糟蹋农夫伯伯的田地呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:16.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是在糟蹋那些田地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:19.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是在找被人类抓走的猿神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.19,0:08:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么猿神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:24.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷本来是庙里供奉的神明
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:28.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是猿神大爷身边的小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直帮大神看着寺庙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:32.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便在那边修行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:33.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来因为战争
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:35.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寺庙被烧光了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷附身在里面的神体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.11,0:08:40.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道为什么会被人家偷走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们认为猿神大爷的神体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:44.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这个村子里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.95,0:08:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:48.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们猜想猿神大爷的神体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被埋在田地里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.19,0:08:52.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为猿神大爷曾经托梦给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.46,0:08:57.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也梦见过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.23,0:08:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也有 我也梦过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:09:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷说 他被埋在一个又暗又湿的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:05.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大爷告诉我那个地方 小得他都快喘不过气了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.97,0:09:09.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷也跟我说 他很怕闻到那些蔬菜的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.48,0:09:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么东西在靠近我们耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.49,0:09:21.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样子好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:23.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐不骂你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们先帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.49,0:09:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先解开犬夜叉身上的咒语好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这恐怕不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经把咒语忘光了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:37.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么跟什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们再捣蛋下去 小心会挨揍受伤哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:42.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这家伙不管是大人小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:45.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要惹毛他都照打不误 知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:46.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是故意捣蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:49.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的忘得一干二净了 什么都记不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:09:58.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了你们 等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要找到猿神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:01.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咒语自然就解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:02.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这些咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来就是猿神大爷他教我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.93,0:10:07.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看还是尽快先回村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想办法找到神体再说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:11.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先走咯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.07,0:10:14.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好乖乖待在这边别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.81,0:10:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.81,0:10:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你累不累啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.65,0:10:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:21.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫我老待在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:23.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:26.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不像样啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:28.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你变成什么样子了 臭笨狗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:31.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们…你们两个臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:36.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你这副德行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:38.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把铁碎牙也耍不动了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:41.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留给你太可惜了 别碰我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:43.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后我会帮你照顾戈薇的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:46.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦皮狼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:50.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙就由我做哥哥的替你保管吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:53.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:54.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们别走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 别走啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不需要等到你们来帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:03.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要找猿神大爷的神体
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.73,0:11:06.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就在村子里才对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:07.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定在村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:09.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快还给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真没听过啊 什么神体的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:13.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么快就赶到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好不要再跟我们装傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.14,0:11:18.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找不到猿神大爷我们会没命的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:20.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点还给我们 还给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.71,0:11:21.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.61,0:11:26.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是想怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不把大石头替我拿掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会宰了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:32.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你动作还真快耶 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.49,0:11:33.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别靠那么近好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:35.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.62,0:11:38.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在还想不出移开石头的咒语吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:40.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全想不出来…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:45.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几只小猴子就可以用法术把你困在石头上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:48.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的是犬神大爷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我早说了 是你们自己把我当成神的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.51,0:11:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实 他离犬神大爷还差得远呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:57.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说只有猿神大爷才知道解咒的方法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:11:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:01.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你们继续隐瞒下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个村子早晚会完蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:05.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:09.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:10.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我安静一点不要说话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:13.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看大家分头去找找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:15.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续闹下去大家都会受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:17.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是很不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 有什么线索吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:22.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多是像这么大的一块神圣的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.57,0:12:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面刻着猿神大爷的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:27.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还圆滚滚的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.27,0:12:28.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:31.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后山山腰有一块像这样的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在后山
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:32.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在后山
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:33.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在后山
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:36.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了 就在后山是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:40.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.29,0:12:42.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:43.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得在河边见过像这样的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:52.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在河边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.07,0:12:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在河边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:53.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在河边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.47,0:12:56.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:58.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这块石头一点都不神圣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:00.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次又不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:07.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会在土地公那个林子里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会是在东边地藏王旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:13.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看应该在南方山谷才对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:17.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们家屋檐下好像有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.73,0:13:23.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.47,0:13:30.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个马上给我去找猿神大爷的神体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:40.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:43.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开的期间就发生了这样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.41,0:13:45.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是伤脑筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:47.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:49.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试试用我的法力看能不能帮上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:52.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的可以帮我们找回猿神大爷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:56.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我的法力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要在早上才能发挥作用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:13:59.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系没关系…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:00.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:03.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想晚上找个地方好好睡一觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.97,0:14:05.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下命捡回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:07.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们全都上当啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:10.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚跟他们胡说八道的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:12.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候就一定可以想到办法啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得还是不太安心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.65,0:14:18.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也真是没用哎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.18,0:14:20.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被这种法术困得动弹不得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.95,0:14:21.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:22.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.95,0:14:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怕在这样下去会不可收拾了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:25.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会不可收拾呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这么下去 这只手就一直摆脱不了这颗石头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后没有办法再拿铁碎牙了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:34.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果犬夜叉就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直摆脱不了这颗石头…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:40.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:43.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:44.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快让开 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.75,0:14:52.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂…“岩”爪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.95,0:14:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑什么啊你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这样也不错啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.49,0:15:03.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你又多了一项绝招了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:05.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个臭家伙 又在那边乱想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:08.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果犬夜叉一直摆脱不了石头…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.87,0:15:13.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有办法再等了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:17.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可以说走就走呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:23.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.15,0:15:27.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死丫头 你也想到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:28.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:30.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我试着用风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:33.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吸走这块大石头的话 你说可行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以只吸这块大石头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要力道控制得当
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:38.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定真的可以喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.43,0:15:41.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试试打开风穴 来吸走这块大石头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你靠过来的时候风穴就…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在叫什么鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你有一半的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我什么都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:57.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你在打什么鬼主意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:15:59.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.55,0:16:00.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在再试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.42,0:16:01.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次一定没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.55,0:16:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定不会把你吸进来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.09,0:16:06.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快停手啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你先进屋子算了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:21.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用特地留下来陪我也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:23.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你一个人待在这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:24.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会很寂寞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:26.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会寂寞啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:28.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嫌我烦那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有嫌你烦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.21,0:16:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:32.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.55,0:16:35.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事还真是伤脑筋耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道有没有别的办法…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.39,0:16:44.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:46.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:49.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小地方就只有这种东西招待大家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:51.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在不成敬意…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:54.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腌菜怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.27,0:16:56.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是光芒是神光吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.17,0:16:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:16:58.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些菜是从这边的菜园采的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:04.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定是猿神大爷发出来的神光
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:07.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷托梦告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他住在一个又暗又湿的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:11.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地方很小喘不过气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:13.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个有臭菜味的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.23,0:17:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子果然是埋在田里没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:21.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是被埋在很深很深的土里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:22.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:23.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上把整个村子翻过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:25.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.20,0:17:27.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会又要作出那种事吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:32.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有样东西想要请你让我看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:38.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这块腌菜用的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:39.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还闪闪发亮的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不就是神体吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:44.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.19,0:17:44.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪闪发亮？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:46.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我怎么看不出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:49.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们居然作出这么该死的事情来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:53.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来猿神大爷真的是你们偷走的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石头是我们在村外捡到的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:59.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是想拿来压腌菜缸刚好合用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:01.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是指在森林之外的地方捡到的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:02.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:06.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷一直好好的待在森林里面的寺庙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:09.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们几个小精灵看守得可仔细了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 就连发生火灾那一次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:14.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是想尽办法 誓死保护猿神大爷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:19.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把猿神大爷抬到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样总该安全了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 有松果耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且有好多耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:34.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 这边也有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:40.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:43.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换句话说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们自己把这件事情给忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先用净水清洗一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.43,0:18:58.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等你们好久啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:03.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于又见到您老人家了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些蔬菜臭死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:12.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个小家伙有没有不乖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.91,0:19:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我们全都很乖…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:15.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心把犬夜叉给忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:25.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷要大家再帮他盖座新庙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.69,0:19:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,定时祭拜他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:29.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他就会保佑全村的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:35.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:37.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于摆脱那块石头了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫名其妙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无缘无故又在路上耽搁了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姑娘你真聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:45.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然一下子就猜中我在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:46.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要好好的答谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您给我提示那么明显 很容易就发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个根本就是笨过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.19,0:19:55.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是口口声声说一定在田里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:57.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要大家赶快去挖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.62,0:19:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:01.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你们最好赶快离开这吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.06,0:20:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到外边有点不寻常
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:05.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不寻常？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:09.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被放进腌菜缸之后不久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:12.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然感觉到一股从没有遇到过的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:15.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股可怕的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:18.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就从村子的上空飘过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.25,0:20:21.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:22.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷后来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.45,0:20:25.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是什么样的妖气 我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.55,0:20:29.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在缸里还追踪过它呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:29.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:32.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股妖气跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.09,0:20:33.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来就不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.09,0:20:34.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.93,0:20:38.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股妖气并没有走得太远
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:40.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是很快地突然就不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.67,0:20:41.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有错 那一定是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:47.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖气是往丑寅方向移动的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.07,0:20:49.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丑寅方向…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不就是东北方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:52.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:55.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就一点都感觉不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:57.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.85,0:21:01.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经可以决定接下来该往哪边去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:17.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.81,0:21:21.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是松果吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:25.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些死小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.75,0:21:27.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓到你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.95,0:21:29.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次报仇了 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:31.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次也报仇了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:32.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:41.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.63,0:21:47.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几个小家伙 还挺好玩的不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是还没有断奶的小猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.31,0:21:59.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.55,0:22:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:07.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好烦哦 走快点行不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标是丑寅方向
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.51,0:22:20.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.72,0:22:30.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.03,0:22:39.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.54,0:22:49.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:54.05,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.35,0:22:58.69,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.99,0:23:07.53,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.27,0:23:12.57,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:17.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:25.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.65,0:23:35.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.11,0:23:49.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说戈薇病倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.65,0:23:51.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近大家忙着寻找奈落把她给累坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.15,0:23:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说不但感冒而且还发烧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.42,0:23:55.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才急急忙忙的赶回家
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.89,0:23:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该要不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.66,0:23:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们那边医药那么发达
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:24:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想没问题 应该很快就会好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.29,0:24:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.39,0:24:03.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像又偷偷去找戈薇了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.56,0:24:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去探病是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.73,0:24:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都看不出犬夜叉这小子这么体贴
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.37,0:24:09.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:11.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和他之间的探病大战
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.90,0:24:14.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和他？到底谁跟谁啊
